# Frontend: Phosh, for Android-phone form factors (oneplus-*,
# xiaomi-beryllium and friends). PLACEHOLDER.
#
# Buildroot has no phosh, phoc, squeekboard or feedbackd packages, and no
# ModemManager-based call stack. Phosh also expects logind and GSettings
# plumbing that this systemd-free image does not carry, so packaging it in
# external/ means solving the session-manager gap too (phoc alone is
# wlroots-based and would be the easy part - wlroots is already here).
#
# Until then this fragment deliberately sets nothing: a board including it
# fails loudly at the review stage rather than half-building a shell. The
# default EmulationStation/sway frontend stays in effect - which is also
# what the phone boards ship today.
